{"sourceUrl":"https://cc.nankai.edu.cn/2026/0709/c13297a600172/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:04.671414+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cc.nankai.edu.cn/2026/0709/c13297a600172/page.htm","html":"<div><p> <p><strong><span><span>一、学院介绍</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>（一）计算机学院</span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yz4y1D7ff\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><u><span>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yz4y1D7ff</span></u></a></p><p><span><span>（二）密码与网络空间安全学院</span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Qa4y1a7eG\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><u><span>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Qa4y1a7eG</span></u></a></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>二、报名条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>（一）基本条件：</span></span></p><p><span>1<span>．中华人民共和国公民。</span></span></p><p><span>2<span>．拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好。</span></span></p><p><span>3<span>．身心健康状况符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></span></p><p><span>4<span>．在本科就读高校可取得推荐资格的</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>届优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p><p><span>5<span>．研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业素养。</span></span></p><p><span>6<span>．诚实守信，学风端正，不存在任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为。</span></span></p><p><span>7<span>．教育部规定的其他条件要求。</span></span></p><p><span>8<span>、对计算机</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>网络空间安全</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>密码等</span></span><span><span>相关学科有浓厚的兴趣，愿意从事科学研究工作。</span></span></p><p><span>9<span>、英语水平</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>应符合以下任一项）：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>通过全国大学英语六级考试（六级成绩</span>425<span>分及以上）或通过全国大学英语四级考试且成绩为优秀（四级成绩</span><span>550</span><span>分及以上）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）</span></span><span>TOEFL<span>成绩</span><span>90</span><span>分（</span><span>120</span><span>分制）及以上或</span><span>4.5</span><span>分（</span><span>6</span><span>分制）及以上</span><span>;</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）</span><span>IELTS</span><span>（</span><span>A</span><span>类</span><span>/</span><span>学术类）成绩</span><span>6</span><span>分及以上；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>4<span>）</span><span>GRE</span><span>成绩在</span><span>310</span><span>以上，</span><span>GMAT</span><span>成绩在</span><span>640</span><span>以上；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>5<span>）英语专业四级（及以上）考试合格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）优先条件：</span></span></p><p><span>1<span>、本科期间获得校级或以上科研类设计大赛前两名或团体第一名。</span></span></p><p><span>2<span>、科研项目主要参加人员。</span></span></p><p><span>3<span>、在</span><span>CCF</span><span>推荐会议和期刊、</span><span>SCI</span><span>、核心期刊上发表过一篇或以上学术论文（个人排名前三名）。</span></span></p><p><span>4<span>、团队沟通能力突出，具有较强组织协调能力。</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>三、申请方式及流程</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>（一）</span></span><strong><span><span>网上报名</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>登录南开大学接收推免生报名信息采集系统（</span><a href=\"https://yzxt.nankai.edu.cn/intern/frontend/web/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://yzxt.nankai.edu.cn/intern/frontend/web/</a><span>）填写报名信息。学院将在报名结束后，对所有报名考生进行集中审核通过。</span></span></p><p><span><span>报考专业，可选择以下：</span></span></p><p><span>1<span>、计算机学院：</span></span></p><ul><li><span><span>科学学位硕士：</span>081200<span>计算机科学与技术</span></span></li><li><span><span>专业学位硕士：</span><a href=\"https://cc.nankai.edu.cn/2026/0709/c13297a600172/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>085400<span>电子信息</span><span>——085404</span><span>计算机技术</span></span></li><li><span><span>直接攻博生（学术博士）：</span>081200<span>计算机科学与技术</span></span></li><li><span><span>直接攻博生（专业学位博士）：</span>0854</span><span><span>04</span><span>计算机技术</span></span></li></ul><p><span>2<span>、密码与网络空间安全学院</span><span>:</span></span></p><ul><li><span><span>科学学位硕士：</span>083900<span>网络空间安全</span></span></li><li><span><span>专业学位硕士：</span><a href=\"https://cc.nankai.edu.cn/2026/0709/c13297a600172/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>085400<span>电子信息</span><span>——085412</span><span>网络与信息安全</span></span></li><li><span><span>专业学位硕士：</span>145200 <span>密码</span></span></li><li><span><span>直接攻博生（学术博士）</span><span>：</span>083900<span>网络空间安全</span></span></li><li><span><span>直接攻博生（专业学位博士）：</span>0854</span><span><span>12</span><span>网络与信息安全</span></span></li></ul><p><span><span>（二</span></span><strong><span><span>）网上报名完成后，须将以下报名材料发到相关导师和实验室邮箱</span>(<span>重要</span><span>)</span><span>：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）个人简历</span></span><span><span>（要求包括：手机号和邮箱，并附英语最高水平成绩复印件，如英语六级成绩单复印件）</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）南开大学报名网站打印版的申请表</span></span><span><span>（如后续拟录取专业与此次报名专业不一致，不需要再次报名）</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）本科前五学期成绩单扫描件（需加盖本科院校的</span></span><span><span>校级</span></span><span><span>公章：</span></span><span><span>教务处或档案馆等，不是学院公章</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>4<span>）专业排名证明扫描件（需加盖本科院校的</span></span><span><span>校级</span></span><span><span>公章：</span></span><span><span>教务处或档案馆等，不是学院公章</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>5<span>）体现自身学术水平、科研能力的获奖证书、代表性学术论文等（如有论文，附首页即可，不需要全文）。</span></span></p><p><span>2<span>、相关链接：</span></span></p><p><span> </span><span><span>计算机学院师资队伍：</span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://cc.nankai.edu.cn/13250/list.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><u><span>https://cc.nankai.edu.cn/13250/list.htm</span></u></a></p><p><span><span>密码与网络空间安全学院师资队伍：</span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://cyber.nankai.edu.cn/13336/list.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><u><span>https://cyber.nankai.edu.cn/13336/list.htm</span></u></a><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>四、报名起止时间：即日起至</span></span></strong><strong><span>202</span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span><span>12</span><span>日</span></span></strong></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>五、说明</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1<span>、</span></span><span><span>学生须承诺所有报名材料和信息均属实，如有弄虚作假，一经查实，取消本人报名资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>、获得推免资格的本科生，可申报攻读我院三年制硕士研究生或五年制博士研究生（直接攻博），也可在硕士研究生入学后第三学期或第五学期申请转博（硕博连读）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span><span>、南开大学为推免研究生提供优厚的奖学金、助学金。研究生奖学金、助学金情况如有变动，以学校最新文件为准。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span><span>、后续通知将在我院网站</span><span>“</span><span>研究生招生</span><span>”</span><span>栏目第一时间公布，请随时关注。以上内容如有变化，请以最新信息为准。</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>五、联系方式：</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系邮箱：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:liufei@nankai.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><u><span><span>018055</span></span></u><u><span>@nankai.edu.cn</span></u></a></p> </p>  <div> </div></div>","textSha256":"8699d0483c3e10d279b39b24617517429953582b261a2c10c113770622dc5429","textLength":1662,"sourceSha256":"1d05f6f78678ce15dddf94c28c70ee48eec49424e9dc65c4f9af1a4fa27c383e","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-e217debdccd5cda1c89f","title":"2026年南开大学计算机学院、密码与网络空间安全学院2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:04.671414+00:00"}
